-## Iteration 3 - Story: US-874 Automatic language detection and response in Chinese (Mandarin) and Tamil
-
-### What was implemented
-- **Already implemented**: Full multilingual pipeline was already in place from prior stories (US-418, US-462):
-  - Language detection via ELD library + pattern-based fast path (`language-router.ts`)
-  - Per-JID language preference persistence with confidence thresholds (`language-preference.ts`)
-  - System prompt language injection in `kb-loading.ts` ("LANGUAGE INSTRUCTION: Always reply in {lang}")
-  - Foreign language translation for non-supported scripts (Thai, Japanese, etc.)
-  - Tamil excluded from foreign-language translation (handled natively)
-
-- **Gap filled — Tamil test coverage**: Added 33 new tests in `multilingual-detection.test.ts` covering:
-  - AC1: Detection for all 4 languages (en/ms/zh/ta) with real-world messages
-  - AC2: `detectLanguage()` wrapper defaults unknown to 'en'
-  - AC3: Tamil NOT treated as foreign language (no unnecessary translation)
-  - AC4: Language override via `resolveResponseLanguage()` with confidence thresholds
-  - AC5: System prompt adapted per-language (English/Malay/Chinese/Tamil instructions)
-  - AC6: Performance — 1000 detections in <200ms
-
-- **Tamil tests added to `language-router.test.ts`**: Simple Tamil, Tamil sentences, mixed Tamil-English, confidence scoring
-- **Fixed `language-resolution.test.ts`**: Replaced stale replicated function with actual import from `routing.ts`; added 5 Tamil-specific tests
-
-### Patterns discovered
-- Tamil detection uses Unicode block `\u0B80-\u0BFF` — instant pattern match, 0.95 confidence
-- `detectFullLanguage()` in `formatter.ts` explicitly skips Tamil (returns null) — handled by native template system
-- Language system spans 4 files: `language-router.ts` (detect), `language-preference.ts` (persist), `kb-loading.ts` (prompt inject), `routing.ts` (resolve)
-- `resolveExperimentPrompt` from `lib/experiments.ts` is imported by `kb-loading.ts` — tests need DB connection string available
-
-### Gotchas
-- `language-resolution.test.ts` had a STALE replicated function that didn't include 'ta' — now imports the real function
-- All 7 test failures in full suite are pre-existing (webhook-routing mock issues), not related to this story
