-  - Upserts `rainbow_portfolio_tier` in app_settings with new tier value from `max_daily_conversation_per_phone`
-  - Upserts `rainbow_portfolio_tier_updated_at` timestamp
-  - Upserts `rainbow_max_phone_numbers` if `max_phone_numbers_per_business` is provided
-  - Reads previous tier via `getCurrentTier()` before updating, so notification can show old→new
