-### Patterns discovered
-- Meta Cloud API webhook payloads use consistent `entry[].changes[].field/value` structure across all webhook fields
-- Existing `getCurrentTier()` from messaging-limits.ts is reusable for reading previous tier
-- `updatedBy` field on app_settings allows distinguishing manual admin updates vs webhook-driven updates
